sequenceDiagram
    participant Admin as Admin Browser
    participant API as Render / Spring Boot
    participant JWT as JWT Filter / Security
    participant DB as Aiven MySQL

    Admin->>API: POST /api/auth/login
    API->>DB: Load administrator identity (implementation-specific)
    DB-->>API: Administrator record / password hash
    API-->>Admin: Authentication result and JWT (verify exact contract)
    Admin->>API: Protected CRUD request + Bearer token
    API->>JWT: Validate token and establish authentication
    JWT-->>API: Authenticated principal or reject
    API->>DB: Authorized create/read/update/delete operation
    DB-->>API: Result
    API-->>Admin: JSON response / HTTP status
